  "manual": "Phone settings. Display > Theme sets the theme of every app that follows the system. Apps > (an app) > Appearance sets that one app's theme and overrides the system theme for it. Apps > Maps > Storage: 'Clear cache' deletes only temporary files; 'Clear storage' deletes everything Maps saved, including the downloaded offline maps. Apps > (an app) > Permissions > Location allows or denies location for that app only; Privacy > Location turns location off for every app; Privacy > Permission manager > Location lists each app's own setting. Battery > Battery saver also pauses background sync for every account. Battery > Battery usage and Apps > Photos can restrict one app's background activity. Notifications > Do not disturb silences every app. Apps > Mail > Notifications turns notifications off for every mail account; Accounts > (an account) > Notifications turns them off for that account only. Accounts > (an account) > Remove account deletes that account's mail and contacts from the phone."
